From 926896968d9d9ef1c478e2872cd3e6190dc59842 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:39:26 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(workflow): pick a project's workflow by a select
 property (Type)

Table project_workflow_rule (add-only, no foreign keys): in a project, an
issue whose select property has an option follows another workflow; anything
else follows the project's workflow. ForIssue resolves rule -> project ->
Default for issue writes, create, the claim brief and the gate check.
API GET/PUT /api/projects/{id}/workflow-rules (owner/admin). Changing the
property moves a status the new workflow lacks to its equivalent, like a
project move; an agent cannot change it while the issue waits on a person.
Workspace deletion removes the rules.

Patch-Id: workflow-by-type
